{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26290","headline":"春色满皇州 · 沈亚之","name":"春色满皇州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处春辉好，偏宜在雍州。\n花明夹城道，柳暗曲江头。\n风软游丝重，光融瑞气浮。\n鬬鸡怜短草，乳燕傍高楼。\n绣毂盈香陌，新泉溢御沟。\n回看日欲暮，还骑似川流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}